      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "If anyone has images from before the user profile update (anything before build 1885) where you click on a friend from the Friends wing on the Quick Menu, and see information including their current world location, I would appreciate it as that will help us describe what we want better.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
